<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--PaineWebber analyst David Lothson said he upgraded Guidant Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>--Shares in the Indianapolis-based medical device manufacturer were off 3/8 at 44.</p>
<p>--&quot;This is a good opportunity,&quot; Lothson said regarding a decline in Guidant's share price prompted by its cancellation of a proposed secondary equity offering on Friday and its release of third-quarter earnings earlier in the week.</p>
<p>--Lothson also said he raised his 1996 earnings estimate for the company to $2.10 per share from $2.06 per share.</p>
<p>--K. Drawbaugh 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
